<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">talk</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">talk</ansi> command initiates a conversation with
an NPC. The NPC will greet you and may offer hints about
quests, local lore, or things they can help with.

Use <ansi fg="command">ask</ansi> to follow up on specific topics.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">talk</ansi> <ansi fg="cyan"><npc></ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">talk to</ansi> <ansi fg="cyan"><npc></ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Examples: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">talk saris</ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">talk to korvath</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">See Also: </ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">help ask</ansi>

